  Slug: woodland-elf
  DisplayName: Woodland Elf
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/features/ancestry/woodland-elf.webp
  Description: You're adapted to life in the forest, the deep jungle, or a similar
    environment, and you know how to climb trees and use foliage to your advantage.
    When Climbing trees, vines, and other foliage, you move at half your Speed on
    a success and at full Speed on a critical success (and you move at full Speed
    on a success if you have @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Quick Climb]).
    This doesn't affect you if you're using a climb Speed. You can always use the
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Take Cover] action when you are within
    forest terrain to gain cover, even if you're not next to an obstacle you can
    Take Cover behind.
